# Data

## Raw Data

Raw dataset too large to upload to GitHub (4M+ rows). Not included in this repo.

**Source:** NYC Taxi Trip Records — https://www.nyc.gov/site/tlc/about/tlc-trip-record-data.page
**Download:** https://www.nyc.gov/site/tlc/about/tlc-trip-record-data.page
**Format:** Parquet
**Size:** ~4,090,836 rows × 20 columns
**Date range:** May 2026

To reproduce this analysis, download raw data from link above and place in `data/raw/`.

## Data Dictionary

`data_dictionary.pdf` included in this folder describes all 20 columns, data types, and definitions used in raw dataset.

## Processed Data

Cleaned dataset (after filtering, outlier removal, feature engineering) generated by running `notebooks/analysis.ipynb`. Not uploaded here — reproducible via code + raw data above.
